so.onmicrosoft.com\"\n\t\t\tDomainType = \"InternalRelay\"\n\t\t\tEnsure = \"Present\"\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t@{\n\t\tdisplayName = \"Mail Contact Resource\"\n\t\tresourceType = \"microsoft.exchange.mailcontact\"\n\t\tproperties = @{\n\t\t\tName = \"Chris\"\n\t\t\tDisplayName = \"Chris\"\n\t\t\tExternalEmailAddress = \"SMTP:chris@fabrikam.com\"\n\t\t\tAlias = \"Chrisa\"\n\t\t\tEnsure = \"Present\"\n\t\t}\n\t}\n)\n}\nparameters = @{\nFQDN = \"contoso.onmicrosoft.com\"\n}\n}\n\nUpdate-MgAdminConfigurationManagementConfigurationMonitor -ConfigurationMonitorId $configurationMonitorId -BodyParameter $params"],"permissions":["ConfigurationMonitoring.ReadWrite.All"]}}}